areer History/Core Competencies/Academics intact).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Card menu → Duplicate created \\\"QA Engineer Resume (Copy)\\\" with identical content; renamed it to \\\"Senior QA Manager Resume\\\" via Rename dialog; edited name→\\\"Jane COPY Tester\\\", location→\\\"Denver, CO\\\", company→\\\"Globex COPY Inc\\\". Reopening the source \\\"QA Engineer Resume\\\" showed original values (Jane Tester / Austin, TX / Globex Inc) unchanged.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Session now holds 6 distinct resumes including 3 created this session: \\\"QA Engineer Resume\\\" (Jane ORIGINAL Tester), \\\"Senior QA Manager Resume\\\" (duplicate, Jane COPY Tester/Denver CO), and \\\"Startup Application Resume\\\" (Jane Startup). Each retains its own independent content and template.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search \\\"qa engineer\\\" (lowercase) matched \\\"QA Engineer Resume\\\"; \\\"RESUME\\\" (uppercase) matched all 6 — case-insensitive. Clearing the box restored all 6. Sort combobox \\\"Newest First\\\" listed Aug 28 2026 items first down to Jan 20 2024; \\\"Oldest First\\\" reversed to Jan 20 2024 → Aug 28 2026.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No date filter feature exists on the dashboard\", \"actual\": \"Dashboard controls consist only of one text input (placeholder \\\"Search resumes...\\\") and a sort combobox (Newest/Oldest First, Title A-Z/Z-A). There is no date picker, no exact-date field, no date-range inputs, and no clear-date control. Entering a date \\\"2024-02-10\\\" into the search box yields \\\"No resumes found\\\", so date narrowing is impossible.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No date-period validation on work experience entries\", \"actual\": 