ack.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing contact/summary/experience values updated the \\\"Live Preview\\\" pane immediately with no save action; clicking a different template button re-rendered the preview instantly. No manual save or refresh required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Reordering (Skills moved above Education) and toggling Education visibility updated the Live Preview immediately with no save. After navigating to other tabs, to the dashboard, and reopening the resume, the preview still shows the custom order ...Career History, Core Competencies, Academics.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"No save button exists; edits made across Contact/Summary/Experience/Education/Skills/Template/Sections tabs were all retained after navigating back to dashboard and reopening the resume. Dashboard card showed \\\"Updated Aug 28, 2026\\\" (today) reflecting the update.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modern preview renders all visible sections with content (contact, About Me, Career History with both jobs, Core Competencies, Academics). Expanded summary to 476 chars so document scrollHeight 1044 > viewport 720; scrolling to bottom brought the final \\\"Academics\\\" section into view (bounding top 351 < 720), so full resume is readable via scroll.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After switching among all 7 editor tabs, returning to dashboard and reopening \\\"QA Engineer Resume\\\": Contact inputs still hold Jane Tester/jane@test.com/(555) 987-6543/Austin, TX/linkedin.com/in/janetester/janetester.com, and preview still shows summary, both jobs (Globex, Acme), State University education and Playwright/TypeScript skills.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Copy edits (Jane COPY Tester / Denver, CO / Globex COPY Inc) left the original at Jane Tester / Austin, TX / Globex Inc. Then editing the original's name to \\\"Jane ORIGINAL Tester\\\" and reopening the copy showed the copy still at \\\"Jane COPY Tester\\\" / \\\"Denver, CO\\\" / \\\"Globex COPY Inc\\\" — no cross-contamination in either direction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Renamed \\\"Untitled Resume\\\" → \\\"QA Engineer Resume\\\"; editor header shows heading \\\"QA Engineer Resume\\\" and the dashboard card heading also shows \\\"QA Engineer Resume\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Customized Summary section heading is not rendered in the Minimal template\", \"actual\": \"Renamed headings to About Me / Career History / Core Competencies / Academics. Modern and Classic previews show all four. In Minimal, the summary section is visible (switch on, body text rendered) but its heading is absent: preview h2 list is only [\\\"CAREER HISTORY\\\",\\\"CORE COMPETENCIES\\\",\\\"ACADEMICS\\\"] — no \\\"ABOUT ME\\\" anywhere in the preview text.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
